WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.602 --> 00:00:04.037
[cameraman] <i> How do you feel
when you wear it?</i>

00:00:04.104 --> 00:00:06.373
[Anna] <i> It feels like invisibility cloak.</i>

00:00:06.439 --> 00:00:08.608
<i>When you are
traveling through checkpoints,</i>

00:00:08.675 --> 00:00:09.676
<i>it's a lifesaver.</i>

00:00:15.782 --> 00:00:18.184
[Ole] <i> The border to Syria is closed.</i>

00:00:18.251 --> 00:00:19.486
[dogs barking]

00:00:19.552 --> 00:00:21.454
<i>The plan is to smuggle ourselves in.</i>

00:00:21.521 --> 00:00:24.057
[Anna] <i> Nothing compares
to being on the ground...</i>

00:00:24.124 --> 00:00:26.226
<i>in the level of investigation
that you can conduct.</i>

00:00:28.595 --> 00:00:31.031
[Fred] <i> In darkness, abuse takes place.</i>

00:00:31.097 --> 00:00:35.201
I see our job
as putting a bit of a brake on that.

00:00:36.403 --> 00:00:39.773
[Peter] <i> With our emergency approach,
we changed the game of human rights.</i>

00:00:40.040 --> 00:00:43.209
<i>We're closer to
criminal investigators.</i>

00:00:43.743 --> 00:00:46.646
[Ole] <i> After the 10th time
they've heard the bombs dropping,</i>

00:00:46.713 --> 00:00:47.747
people get used to it.

00:00:47.814 --> 00:00:50.383
I would not get used to it.

00:00:50.450 --> 00:00:51.451
[Anna] <i> He's 12 years old.</i>

00:00:51.518 --> 00:00:55.622
<i>The idea that you or anybody else can die
is such an abstract.</i>

00:00:55.688 --> 00:00:59.159
-They bombed Azaz just half an hour ago.
-What?

00:00:59.225 --> 00:01:00.627
<i>Is it a good idea to go there?</i>

00:01:03.096 --> 00:01:04.597
[bomb exploding]

00:01:07.400 --> 00:01:12.338
Every person who told me their story,
I owed them their moment in court.

00:01:12.405 --> 00:01:15.341
Our evidence is overwhelming

00:01:15.408 --> 00:01:19.012
<i>that the forces of the Serbian police
and the Yugoslav Army</i>

00:01:19.079 --> 00:01:22.182
<i>purposefully targeted civilians.</i>

00:01:22.248 --> 00:01:27.654
<i>It was horrifying talking to the guy
you were tracking for 10 years.</i>

00:01:30.256 --> 00:01:31.424
[Anna] <i> People are being killed.</i>

00:01:31.491 --> 00:01:34.494
<i>Thousands of people
have been detained and tortured.</i>

00:01:34.561 --> 00:01:36.296
<i>We need to do something right now.</i>

00:01:38.798 --> 00:01:40.166
<i>You meet somebody on the ground,</i>

00:01:40.233 --> 00:01:43.803
<i>a witness, a victim,
an incredible activist,</i>

00:01:44.070 --> 00:01:47.040
<i>and you feel that
if they haven't given up,</i>

00:01:47.107 --> 00:01:49.175
<i>how on earth do you have the right
to give up?</i>

00:01:49.242 --> 00:01:50.677
[guns firing]

00:01:50.743 --> 00:01:53.613
We have to be very careful
because, I mean, they're armed.

00:01:59.652 --> 00:02:04.190
It's nice to be on the right side,
and it's nice to fight back.

